This product embeds the CI/CD configuration schemas published by each
provider, as snapshots in schema/snapshots/. They are included unmodified
and remain under their original licenses:

- github.json: GitHub workflow schema from SchemaStore
  (https://github.com/SchemaStore/schemastore), licensed under the Apache
  License, Version 2.0.
- circleci.json: CircleCI config schema from circleci-yaml-language-server
  (https://github.com/CircleCI-Public/circleci-yaml-language-server),
  Copyright CircleCI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
- gitlab.json: GitLab CI/CD schema from GitLab
  (https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab), Copyright (c) 2011-present GitLab
  Inc., licensed under the MIT License.
- azure.json: Azure Pipelines schema from azure-pipelines-vscode
  (https://github.com/microsoft/azure-pipelines-vscode), Copyright (c)
  Microsoft Corporation, licensed under the MIT License.
- bitbucket.json: Bitbucket Pipelines schema published by Atlassian at
  https://api.bitbucket.org/schemas/pipelines-configuration.

The MIT license texts are reproduced in schema/snapshots/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.
